{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">TVB劇集《非份之罪》單元《危險遊戲》劇情高潮迭起、反轉不斷。在20日一集中，羅冠蘭與江嘉敏上演了一幕極具感染力的母女情深戲碼，而劇尾更爆出驚天大反轉，將全劇懸疑感推至頂峰。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">劇情講到，清姐（羅冠蘭飾）發現Jarvis（吳偉豪飾）是導致女兒曉善（江嘉敏飾）癱瘓的真兇後，決意為女報仇。她從兼職實驗室偷走硫化氫氣罐打算偷龍轉鳳，但在關鍵時刻突然良心發現打消殺機，卻在情急下將氣罐搞亂，最終導致Jarvis吸入高濃度硫化氫身亡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">另一邊廂，曉善得知母親心意後，企圖以調虎離山之計銷毀證物，惟被Gogo Sir（鄭衍峰飾）及時阻止。兩母女最終在羈留室相遇，清姐自責道：「你做咩唔聽阿媽話，留喺度！」曉善忍淚回應：「我唔忍心，你呢世喺度過。」清姐感性反問：「你唔忍心睇住阿媽受苦，阿媽又會忍心你畀人蝦到上心口？」真摯對白與精湛演技令觀眾動容。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"91832f73-23e5-419e-bf09-62cdbc7d9729.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20261tZS1NMCVI1784688527.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"91832f73-23e5-419e-bf09-62cdbc7d9729.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"db85f6a0-e926-478a-87e8-968a5a9b412f.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026WhwOklX5MZ1784688530.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"db85f6a0-e926-478a-87e8-968a5a9b412f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">正當觀眾以為案件塵埃落定之際，劇尾卻迎來戲劇性反轉。劇情揭示先前表現得楚楚可憐的Wendy（胡敏芝飾）原來一直隱瞞真相，目前所有指控與關鍵線索皆指向她，極有可能是隱藏在背後的「終極Big Boss」，為劇情留下極大懸念。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7debcdd2-94d6-4bc1-b52a-a7e521f8269f.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026wCwAUV5BTK1784688534.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7debcdd2-94d6-4bc1-b52a-a7e521f8269f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T11:52:32.613830+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":478,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}